    "text": "Over 23 000 visitors joined us for ESA Open Days 2026, exploring our sites, meeting the people behind our missions and discovering Europe’s space activities. 🚀\n\nRelive some of the highlights, and stay tuned to join us next year: www.youtube.com/watch?v=OUyY...",
